# Firebase Staging Deploy Guidance

The project has a permanent staging site on Firebase Hosting:
- Site ID: `reetle-staging-web`
- Permanent URL: `https://reetle-staging-web.web.app`

When deploying a staging version:

```bash
npm run build
firebase deploy --only hosting:staging
```

When deploying to production:

```bash
firebase deploy --only hosting:production
```
